{
  "info": {
    "name": "auth-service (Reto 5)",
    "description": "Contrato del proveedor de identidad: emisión de tokens, política de contraseñas y separación entre el Access JWT y el token de restablecimiento.\n\nTodo pasa por el api-gateway ({{gatewayBaseUrl}}), igual que lo haría un cliente real.\n\nPRECONDICIÓN: sistema recién levantado (`docker compose down -v && docker compose up --build`). El administrador semilla se crea al arrancar el auth-service.\n\nRequiere el environment `system-hr.postman_environment.json`.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "adminToken",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "empleadoId",
      "value": "E501",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "empleadoEmail",
      "value": "laura.mendez@empresa.com",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "empleadoPassword",
      "value": "Secreta123",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "resetToken",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "userToken",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Login del administrador semilla",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "",
              "const b = pm.response.json();",
              "",
              "pm.test('Devuelve un Bearer con rol ADMIN', () => {",
              "    pm.expect(b.tipo).to.eql('Bearer');",
              "    pm.expect(b.rol).to.eql('ADMIN');",
              "    pm.expect(b.expiraEnSegundos).to.be.a('number');",
              "});",
              "",
              "pm.test('El JWT tiene tres segmentos y los claims del enunciado', () => {",
              "    const partes = b.token.split('.');",
              "    pm.expect(partes).to.have.lengthOf(3);",
              "    const payload = JSON.parse(atob(partes[1].replace(/-/g, '+').replace(/_/g, '/')));",
              "    pm.expect(payload.sub).to.eql(b.empleadoId);",
              "    pm.expect(payload.role).to.eql('ADMIN');",
              "    pm.expect(payload).to.have.property('iat');",
              "    pm.expect(payload).to.have.property('exp');",
              "});",
              "",
              "pm.test('El token no contiene la contraseña', () => {",
              "    const payload = atob(b.token.split('.')[1].replace(/-/g, '+').replace(/_/g, '/'));",
              "    pm.expect(payload.toLowerCase()).to.not.include('password');",
              "});",
              "",
              "pm.collectionVariables.set('adminToken', b.token);"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"usuario\": \"{{adminUsuario}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{adminPassword}}\"\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{gatewayBaseUrl}}/auth/login",
          "host": [
            "{{gatewayBaseUrl}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "auth",
            "login"
          ]
        },
        "description": "Endpoint público. El administrador semilla se crea al arrancar el servicio desde AUTH_SEED_ADMIN_*; sin él no habría forma de ejecutar ninguna operación de escritura."
      },
      "response": []
    },
